          "heading": "Fiji face France in Round Four after previous away friendly defeat",
          "body": "Fiji prepare to face France in Round Four of the tournament, looking to improve on their last meeting in November 2025. In that international friendly, Fiji suffered a 34-21 away defeat. The national side enters the upcoming fixture sitting 12th in the table after a 17-33 loss to Scotland in Round Three. Fiji have yet to secure a victory in the competition, registering three consecutive defeats whilst scoring 49 points and conceding 145."
