          "heading": "England-born Georgie Perris-Redding leads United States into weekend Test match",
          "body": "Former Sale flanker Georgie Perris-Redding is set to captain the US Eagles at Cardiff Arms Park this weekend. Born in Detroit but having developed her game at Crewe & Nantwich, the 29-year-old reflects on a career path that took her from the Premiership to the international stage. Now a full-time professional and a two-time World Cup participant, Perris-Redding admits her time at the American Rugby Professional Training Center was the first moment she realised, \"I want more from my rugby.\""
