          "body": "The United Rugby Championship returns this weekend, marking a pivotal period for players aiming to impress Ireland head coach Andy Farrell ahead of the 2027 Rugby World Cup in Australia. As Leinster begin their defence under outgoing head coach Leo Cullen, internal competition for international selection intensifies across all four provinces. Coaches have reshaped squads over the summer, with Connacht recruiting Ciaran Frawley and Ulster integrating new arrivals, all while balancing domestic ambitions against the looming requirements of the national team programme."
